&lt;h1&gt;


Figma Is a Canvas for Pictures. ExodeUI Is an Engine for Working Software.
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let's state an uncomfortable truth that every frontend developer knows in their heart:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Figma doesn't design software. Figma designs posters that look like software.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


The Illusion of Prototyping
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When you present a Figma prototype to stakeholders:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clicking a button doesn't mutate actual application state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typing into an input doesn't validate regex or test sanitization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scrolling a list doesn't trigger virtualized windowing or lazy pagination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It is a smoke-and-mirrors slideshow masquerading as an application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


What Working Software Actually Requires
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Real software demands:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Deterministic State Transitions:&lt;/strong&gt; Handled via Finite State Machines (FSM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Fluid Physics:&lt;/strong&gt; Damped harmonic motion that reacts to real touch inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Data Binding:&lt;/strong&gt; Real API endpoints feeding live json structures into views.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Accessible Semantics:&lt;/strong&gt; Clean DOM trees with proper ARIA attributes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


Enter ExodeUI
&lt;/h2&gt;

